<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-LIONS V SOUTH AFRICA SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-LIONS V SOUTH AFRICA SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of British Lions series</p>
<p>in South Africa</p>
<p>1910 - South Africa 2-1</p>
<p>1924 - South Africa 3-0, one draw</p>
<p>1938 - South Africa 2-1</p>
<p>1955 - Series drawn 2-2</p>
<p>1962 - South Africa 3-0, one draw</p>
<p>1968 - South Africa 3-0, one draw</p>
<p>1974 - British Lions 3-0, one draw</p>
<p>1980 - South Africa 3-1</p>
</text>
